    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d301">

                <pb facs="0422" n="316" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg316"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Señor Jorge Montt to
                        Mr. Blaine</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Iquique</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-05-16"><hi rendition="#italic">May 16,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>We have the honor to inform your excellency that Mr. Richard L. Trumbull, a
                    representative in the Chilean Congress, has powers from the Governmental Junta
                    to represent us in the United States in the capacity of confidential agent.</p>
                <p>Be pleased, your excellency, to accept him in that capacity.</p>
                <closer><signed>
                        <list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Montt</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                    rendition="#italic">President of the Governmental
                                Junta</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Isidoro Errazuriz</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Secretary Foreign Relations</hi>.</item>
                        </list>
                    </signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
